1
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:11,991
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">FROM ME TO YOU</font>

2
00:01:01,082 --> 00:01:06,003
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">CHRISTMAS</font>

3
00:01:18,349 --> 00:01:19,266
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawa!</font>

4
00:01:20,184 --> 00:01:22,019
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Morning!</font>

5
00:01:28,526 --> 00:01:31,403
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's already the middle of December.</font>

6
00:01:36,826 --> 00:01:38,035
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That hurts.</font>

7
00:01:40,996 --> 00:01:42,206
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm so glad.</font>

8
00:01:43,457 --> 00:01:47,962
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We've finished up with our finals, and
after a very eventful second term, all</font>

9
00:01:48,045 --> 00:01:52,550
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">that's left is to have
our closing ceremony.</font>

10
00:01:53,634 --> 00:01:55,886
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm glad Chizu's doing better.</font>

11
00:01:55,970 --> 00:02:01,142
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Since she got to see Ryu's big brother
one more time, it's like a weight's been</font>

12
00:02:01,225 --> 00:02:06,647
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">lifted. And I guess we all have
Ryu to thank for making that happen.</font>

13
00:02:06,730 --> 00:02:12,486
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Later, while blushing, Chizu told us
how Ryu heard her out and comforted her.</font>

14
00:02:13,445 --> 00:02:18,409
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Seriously, I'm so relieved!
Exams are over too. Life is good!</font>

15
00:02:19,451 --> 00:02:20,452
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No, it's not!</font>

16
00:02:20,536 --> 00:02:22,872
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I have to take remedial classes!
- Uh... nothin' you could</font>

17
00:02:22,955 --> 00:02:25,499
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">do about that this time.</font>

18
00:02:25,583 --> 00:02:28,127
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Really?! Sawako even went out of her way
to make special notes for me, so how! And</font>

19
00:02:28,210 --> 00:02:31,547
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- why only me?!
- I-I... I'm sorry I couldn't</font>

20
00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:34,925
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">help... But you passed? How?!</font>

21
00:02:35,551 --> 00:02:36,886
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I couldn't tell ya.</font>

22
00:02:38,762 --> 00:02:42,975
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If I recall though, don't
remedial classes end before Christmas?</font>

23
00:02:43,058 --> 00:02:47,271
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh yeah, Christmas. How could I forget
that obnoxious, mushy holiday where</font>

24
00:02:47,354 --> 00:02:50,733
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">couples express their
undying love for each other?</font>

25
00:02:50,816 --> 00:02:54,195
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sh - she must really be hurt
to brush off a celebration.</font>

26
00:02:54,278 --> 00:02:58,199
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Plus, on Christmas Eve, we don't even
have to go to school. Those of us who</font>

27
00:02:58,282 --> 00:03:02,203
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">aren't in a relationship
should do something. It'd be fun.</font>

28
00:03:02,286 --> 00:03:05,122
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I already talked about it with Ryu,
Joe, and some of the other guys. Right?</font>

29
00:03:05,206 --> 00:03:08,083
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sure. -We can do a whole gift
exchange and eat some tasty food!</font>

30
00:03:08,167 --> 00:03:11,420
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Tasty food?</font>

31
00:03:11,503 --> 00:03:14,048
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And for the remedial class
group it'll be a wrap party!</font>

32
00:03:14,131 --> 00:03:16,675
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you Kazehaya! You're
inviting the girls too, huh?!</font>

33
00:03:16,759 --> 00:03:19,261
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">C...</font>

34
00:03:19,845 --> 00:03:21,972
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Let's play Truth or Dare! Yay!</font>

35
00:03:22,056 --> 00:03:22,973
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Denied.</font>

36
00:03:24,099 --> 00:03:25,517
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">C- Christmas!</font>

37
00:03:27,978 --> 00:03:29,313
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">With everyone!</font>

38
00:03:43,661 --> 00:03:47,748
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What... does one have to do to attend?
- You don't have to do a darn thing.</font>

39
00:03:47,831 --> 00:03:52,211
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Is Sadako... praying right now?
- Am I invited?</font>

40
00:03:52,294 --> 00:03:54,922
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Aah, so you're gonna be free for
Christmas this year, aren't you Yano-chin?</font>

41
00:03:55,005 --> 00:03:57,633
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Super free.</font>

42
00:03:58,550 --> 00:04:00,302
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">When I say, "everyone"...</font>

43
00:04:01,387 --> 00:04:04,598
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That means "everyone," Kuronuma.</font>

44
00:04:05,724 --> 00:04:06,684
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Everyone?</font>

45
00:04:06,767 --> 00:04:11,188
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Anyway, it's highly likely this'll be
the first and last time I get to spend</font>

46
00:04:11,272 --> 00:04:15,276
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Christmas with you two. My situation
will probably be different next year.</font>

47
00:04:15,359 --> 00:04:19,363
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, you never know,
my sitch could be too!</font>

48
00:04:19,446 --> 00:04:23,325
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's become natural somehow... for
me to be seen as part of "everyone."</font>

49
00:04:23,409 --> 00:04:27,329
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Then I'll post this paper on the wall
like usual, so whoever wants to</font>

50
00:04:27,413 --> 00:04:31,250
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">participate, write your name down 'kay?.</font>

51
00:04:33,711 --> 00:04:35,087
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's okay...</font>

52
00:04:35,170 --> 00:04:36,588
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, good work!</font>

53
00:04:36,672 --> 00:04:39,174
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you sir. If I go... it's okay.</font>

54
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:57,651
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If I... write my name on here... it's okay.</font>

55
00:05:01,572 --> 00:05:03,615
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've always wanted this.</font>

56
00:05:06,785 --> 00:05:10,748
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But wait... I'm supposed to celebrate
Christmas with my family. When I get home</font>

57
00:05:10,831 --> 00:05:14,793
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll ask my mom and dad
about it straight away.</font>

58
00:05:18,672 --> 00:05:21,550
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, you were... still here, huh?</font>

59
00:05:21,633 --> 00:05:22,551
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Y- Yes.</font>

60
00:05:24,345 --> 00:05:25,888
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}CHRISTMAS PARTY</font>

61
00:05:38,192 --> 00:05:41,904
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You aren't going, Kuronuma?
- Uh... I was going to</font>

62
00:05:41,987 --> 00:05:45,741
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- ask my parents and then-
- You should go.</font>

63
00:05:51,163 --> 00:05:52,081
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Let's go.</font>

64
00:05:58,212 --> 00:06:00,047
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wanna go!</font>

65
00:06:02,883 --> 00:06:05,344
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Not just a family Christmas...</font>

66
00:06:06,178 --> 00:06:08,889
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Christmas spent with my friends...</font>

67
00:06:17,564 --> 00:06:22,403
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And my first Christmas... where
I'll get to be... with Kazehaya.</font>

68
00:06:32,788 --> 00:06:35,999
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Actually... For Chizu, I have an apron!</font>

69
00:06:37,126 --> 00:06:39,294
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">For Ayane, a few coasters!</font>

70
00:06:40,212 --> 00:06:43,799
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I already handmade so many presents in
advance. A belly warmer for my dad. And</font>

71
00:06:43,882 --> 00:06:47,428
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">slippers for my mom.</font>

72
00:06:47,511 --> 00:06:51,515
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What would be good to bring for the
present exchange? Oh, right, I still need</font>

73
00:06:51,598 --> 00:06:55,686
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}to ask if I can go
first. Also, for Kazehaya...</font>

74
00:07:02,359 --> 00:07:05,779
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No way. A handmade scarf would be a bit
much, wouldn't it? It's scary just to</font>

75
00:07:05,863 --> 00:07:09,241
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">think about it.</font>

76
00:07:09,324 --> 00:07:14,163
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Even if I did crochet one... I
wouldn't be able to hand it to him.</font>

77
00:07:14,246 --> 00:07:15,789
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm sure of that.</font>

78
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:30,971
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It won't hurt just to crochet
it. I'll just do it for fun.</font>

79
00:07:31,054 --> 00:07:33,015
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako, Dad just got home!</font>

80
00:07:33,891 --> 00:07:40,689
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Okay! Now's my chance to ask if
I can go to the Christmas party.</font>

81
00:07:40,772 --> 00:07:44,193
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hi Dad, so welcome
home... About Christmas--</font>

82
00:07:44,276 --> 00:07:47,654
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh! That's right! We
can't forget that, Sawako!</font>

83
00:07:47,738 --> 00:07:51,909
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You haven't had the chance to tell Santa
Claus what you want for your present this</font>

84
00:07:51,992 --> 00:07:56,163
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">year, have you? And if you don't
hurry, he may stop taking requests!</font>

85
00:07:56,246 --> 00:08:00,792
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Um... let's see... a notebook... and
lead for my mechanical pencil...</font>

86
00:08:00,876 --> 00:08:04,880
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Even your dad can go
out and buy those things!</font>

87
00:08:06,006 --> 00:08:09,218
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Think big. Santa's
feeling generous this year!</font>

88
00:08:09,301 --> 00:08:12,721
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">O- Okay...</font>

89
00:08:12,804 --> 00:08:17,351
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A mechanical pencil that has a
good pencil grip. Pretty please.</font>

90
00:08:17,434 --> 00:08:21,980
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh Sawako, why are you telling me all of
this? You know you gotta properly write it</font>

91
00:08:22,064 --> 00:08:26,652
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">on paper to hang up!</font>

92
00:08:27,861 --> 00:08:29,112
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What do I do?</font>

93
00:08:30,030 --> 00:08:33,909
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Gosh, Sawako's chicken
last year was so dang tasty!</font>

94
00:08:33,992 --> 00:08:36,411
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But Mom's cooking was absolutely
scrumptious as usual, of course.</font>

95
00:08:36,495 --> 00:08:38,914
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, boy... seems like Dad's
really looking forward to it.</font>

96
00:08:38,997 --> 00:08:41,416
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll be getting work off this year for
Christmas Eve too! So I'll be able to help</font>

97
00:08:41,500 --> 00:08:43,919
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">out. Even starting
first thing in the morning!</font>

98
00:08:44,002 --> 00:08:47,631
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">S- So, Uh... Huh?</font>

99
00:08:47,714 --> 00:08:50,634
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, something wrong? Aha! It's about
the cake, right? We'll let you decide and</font>

100
00:08:50,717 --> 00:08:54,263
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">can't wait to see what you
make this Christmas Eve!</font>

101
00:08:54,346 --> 00:08:57,891
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Y you got it... -And since Sawako's such
a good girl, Santa Claus visits us every</font>

102
00:08:57,975 --> 00:09:01,436
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- single year!
- Uh yeah...</font>

103
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:02,646
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can't ask.</font>

104
00:09:06,608 --> 00:09:07,609
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Let's go.</font>

105
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:15,617
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Actually... Dad, Mom,
there's something I wanted to-</font>

106
00:09:15,701 --> 00:09:19,288
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's also when Sawako was meant to be
born, huh. she was supposed to make her</font>

107
00:09:19,371 --> 00:09:22,958
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">big debut on the 24th.</font>

108
00:09:23,041 --> 00:09:26,753
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It took a while longer though, so you
had us worried. But now, you're completely</font>

109
00:09:26,837 --> 00:09:29,548
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">healthy and all grown up too...</font>

110
00:09:29,631 --> 00:09:32,593
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's right. Brings back memories.</font>

111
00:09:32,676 --> 00:09:36,555
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You ended up making us wait for you until
New Year's Eve. -But to our family, you</font>

112
00:09:36,638 --> 00:09:40,517
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">were still our Christmas present, Sawako.
- Aw, honey, look at you getting all teary</font>

113
00:09:40,601 --> 00:09:44,438
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">eyed!</font>

114
00:09:45,314 --> 00:09:46,231
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Dad, I, uh...</font>

115
00:09:47,316 --> 00:09:50,277
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, that's right. Sawako, you were
trying to say something earlier. What is</font>

116
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:53,363
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- it?
- Uh... Uhh...</font>

117
00:09:57,367 --> 00:09:59,828
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Nothing... Nevermind.</font>

118
00:10:10,756 --> 00:10:13,467
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can't ask them. It's too much.</font>

119
00:10:19,806 --> 00:10:21,058
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What?!</font>

120
00:10:21,141 --> 00:10:22,559
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You aren't going, Sawako?</font>

121
00:10:22,643 --> 00:10:25,312
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No, my dad's excited
about us celebrating together.</font>

122
00:10:25,395 --> 00:10:28,440
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Awww! C'mon, let's go!</font>

123
00:10:28,523 --> 00:10:31,777
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Can't you at least
slip out for a little bit?</font>

124
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:34,154
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Our family has things
planned for the whole day, so...</font>

125
00:10:34,237 --> 00:10:36,573
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Th-That sounds kinda intense.</font>

126
00:10:36,657 --> 00:10:42,537
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">B- But that's why... It might be a
little early to give these to you...</font>

127
00:10:43,914 --> 00:10:47,793
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Awesome, it's an apron! I can wear it
when I'm helping out at Ryu's place!</font>

128
00:10:47,876 --> 00:10:50,629
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ayane, yours are coasters by the way.</font>

129
00:10:50,712 --> 00:10:53,507
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Woah, these are adorable! Hold on,
don't tell me you made these by hand?</font>

130
00:10:53,590 --> 00:10:56,093
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I, uh... did...</font>

131
00:10:57,761 --> 00:11:00,180
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Did I go overboard with those?</font>

132
00:11:00,263 --> 00:11:01,181
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Oh, wow!
- Oh, wow!</font>

133
00:11:02,599 --> 00:11:06,144
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Thanks a bunch for these!
- Thanks, I'll use it a ton!</font>

134
00:11:06,228 --> 00:11:08,480
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They were pleased with them!</font>

135
00:11:09,189 --> 00:11:13,151
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What do you girls got here?
- Oh, these? They're gifts</font>

136
00:11:13,235 --> 00:11:16,071
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">from Sawako. Aren't they nice?</font>

137
00:11:16,154 --> 00:11:19,032
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">These're Christmas
presents she made for us!</font>

138
00:11:19,116 --> 00:11:21,618
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, seriously?! Wow.</font>

139
00:11:26,790 --> 00:11:28,959
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wonder if he'd accept it...</font>

140
00:11:32,838 --> 00:11:35,757
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">J-Just kidding!</font>

141
00:11:35,841 --> 00:11:39,720
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Pretty daring to think that.
- But are you sure that's okay? You</font>

142
00:11:39,803 --> 00:11:43,432
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">didn't want to give the gifts to them on
Christmas Day?</font>

143
00:11:43,515 --> 00:11:47,144
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ah, Sawako says she can't make the party.</font>

144
00:11:47,227 --> 00:11:51,648
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawa-Papa was way too hyped
about Christmas apparently.</font>

145
00:11:51,732 --> 00:11:54,609
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh. So is that true?</font>

146
00:11:55,318 --> 00:11:56,528
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So let's go.</font>

147
00:11:58,989 --> 00:12:00,949
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And I want to!</font>

148
00:12:04,619 --> 00:12:05,537
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yes...</font>

149
00:12:07,664 --> 00:12:08,665
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I see...</font>

150
00:12:09,666 --> 00:12:10,584
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya!</font>

151
00:12:11,126 --> 00:12:12,002
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah?</font>

152
00:12:12,085 --> 00:12:15,005
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's about our Christmas plans.
The place is booked, so we're set!</font>

153
00:12:15,088 --> 00:12:19,968
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Come here a sec. 'kay?
- Sure, thanks.</font>

154
00:12:22,387 --> 00:12:23,305
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako!</font>

155
00:12:24,222 --> 00:12:27,434
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Let's just celebrate on a
different day next year, okay?!</font>

156
00:12:27,517 --> 00:12:31,021
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah, even the 25th would
work and we can party together!</font>

157
00:12:31,104 --> 00:12:35,442
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I hope you have fun at the party!</font>

158
00:12:36,485 --> 00:12:40,405
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just when I was invited
to something like this...</font>

159
00:12:41,198 --> 00:12:47,496
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">CHRISTMAS PARTY
ONE PRESENT 800 YEN</font>

160
00:12:48,955 --> 00:12:50,791
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Maybe... next year.</font>

161
00:13:02,636 --> 00:13:06,264
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And so, December 24th
arrived. Christmas Eve.</font>

162
00:13:08,809 --> 00:13:10,143
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I finished it!</font>

163
00:13:10,852 --> 00:13:15,857
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can't give it to him, but it still
makes me kinda happy. I'll hide my mom and</font>

164
00:13:15,941 --> 00:13:19,277
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">dad's presents for now, so I
can surprise them later on.</font>

165
00:13:19,361 --> 00:13:22,697
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako! Darling! Are you two awake?</font>

166
00:13:23,323 --> 00:13:24,991
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah!</font>

167
00:13:27,786 --> 00:13:32,457
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's freezing!</font>

168
00:13:34,876 --> 00:13:39,172
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- The bathroom's open now.
- Oh, that looks great on you!</font>

169
00:13:39,256 --> 00:13:42,592
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Doesn't it? A perfect fit! Oh Sawako,
thank you for the Christmas present it's</font>

170
00:13:42,676 --> 00:13:46,137
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">fantastic!</font>

171
00:13:47,806 --> 00:13:50,308
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You actually remembered how I was
complaining about my head feeling cold</font>

172
00:13:50,392 --> 00:13:52,894
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- before, didn't you?
- You do have a big</font>

173
00:13:52,978 --> 00:13:55,981
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">forehead after all, dear.</font>

174
00:13:56,064 --> 00:13:59,067
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Gosh it's so cozy and warm. I've always
wanted one of these things. Thank you,</font>

175
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:03,154
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako. Merry
Christmas to you, sweetheart!</font>

176
00:14:08,159 --> 00:14:11,162
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">How nice... I'm glad you like it so much.</font>

177
00:14:12,873 --> 00:14:16,626
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I actually had some presents I was going
to give you later... but here's what I got</font>

178
00:14:16,710 --> 00:14:20,422
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you, Mom. -Well, I couldn't give
it to him anyway. -Thanks, sweetie!</font>

179
00:14:20,505 --> 00:14:24,843
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And I can't deny that it's
better to have someone use it.</font>

180
00:14:24,926 --> 00:14:27,721
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">He's so happy about getting it too.</font>

181
00:14:36,146 --> 00:14:39,733
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wonder if... everyone's
having fun right now...</font>

182
00:14:40,483 --> 00:14:41,943
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What's wrong, Sawako?</font>

183
00:14:42,819 --> 00:14:46,364
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You're having fun, right?
- Mm-hm.</font>

184
00:14:50,994 --> 00:14:52,120
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hm? The phone?</font>

185
00:14:52,203 --> 00:14:53,413
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, I can get it.</font>

186
00:14:56,124 --> 00:14:57,042
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hello?</font>

187
00:14:58,585 --> 00:15:01,171
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, I can't hear anything! Hello?!</font>

188
00:15:02,422 --> 00:15:03,256
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chizu?</font>

189
00:15:03,965 --> 00:15:05,592
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Sawako?
- Okay.</font>

190
00:15:05,675 --> 00:15:07,344
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Shut up, Joe!</font>

191
00:15:07,928 --> 00:15:12,432
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We were all wondering how you were doing
today. It doesn't feel complete without</font>

192
00:15:12,515 --> 00:15:16,978
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you here with us! I'm gonna pass the
phone to Yano-chin now. Here ya go!</font>

193
00:15:17,062 --> 00:15:17,812
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey! Sawako?</font>

194
00:15:19,189 --> 00:15:20,023
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ayane?</font>

195
00:15:20,649 --> 00:15:24,903
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You aren't lonely, are you? We've all
been kinda worried about you. Wish you</font>

196
00:15:24,986 --> 00:15:29,199
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">could've come for at least a little bit.</font>

197
00:15:29,282 --> 00:15:33,995
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But we get it. so here's one of
your Christmas presents. Ready?</font>

198
00:15:35,413 --> 00:15:37,874
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What? Kuronuma?</font>

199
00:15:41,002 --> 00:15:42,963
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's who this is, right?</font>

200
00:15:45,423 --> 00:15:46,967
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It is you... isn't it?</font>

201
00:15:56,393 --> 00:15:59,187
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I want to go... What should I do?</font>

202
00:16:01,564 --> 00:16:03,608
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I... can't even speak.</font>

203
00:16:20,041 --> 00:16:23,545
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako, hand me the phone
so that I can say hello.</font>

204
00:16:24,129 --> 00:16:27,924
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hi there! This is Sawako's mom. Thank
you for taking such good care of her.</font>

205
00:16:28,008 --> 00:16:30,552
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">evening, ma'am.</font>

206
00:16:30,635 --> 00:16:33,221
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh my! Sounds like
you're having fun over there!</font>

207
00:16:33,304 --> 00:16:35,598
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">M- Mom...</font>

208
00:16:36,224 --> 00:16:38,893
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako, come over here for a minute.</font>

209
00:16:41,604 --> 00:16:42,856
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yes, we are.</font>

210
00:16:44,274 --> 00:16:48,319
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But... if Kuronuma came
over, it would be even better.</font>

211
00:16:51,114 --> 00:16:55,744
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Dad... if it's... just for a little bit.</font>

212
00:16:55,827 --> 00:16:58,663
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Can I go and see my friends, please?</font>

213
00:16:58,747 --> 00:17:02,751
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If she were here with us it
would be so much more fun!</font>

214
00:17:08,757 --> 00:17:09,924
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Open this one.</font>

215
00:17:10,008 --> 00:17:10,925
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

216
00:17:11,009 --> 00:17:15,472
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">San-... I-I mean your dad
got it for you. Go on.</font>

217
00:17:24,773 --> 00:17:29,527
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">From now on, tell us these things way
further in advance. We'll call you if it</font>

218
00:17:29,611 --> 00:17:32,947
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">gets too late, so take this with
you! I-I charged it already, so.</font>

219
00:17:33,031 --> 00:17:36,367
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I love it Dad! Thanks so much!</font>

220
00:17:39,996 --> 00:17:42,165
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, my, did Sawako just leave?</font>

221
00:17:43,124 --> 00:17:47,253
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah... So this day has finally come, huh...</font>

222
00:17:48,630 --> 00:17:51,758
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You'd better prepare yourself, honey.
This is only the beginning for our little</font>

223
00:17:51,841 --> 00:17:55,011
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">girl.</font>

224
00:17:57,972 --> 00:17:59,390
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Will I make it?</font>

225
00:18:00,266 --> 00:18:02,393
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Okay, everyone, I think it's
about time we call it a night.</font>

226
00:18:02,477 --> 00:18:04,604
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Already?
- Let's hope there'll be</font>

227
00:18:04,687 --> 00:18:06,815
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- less of us singles next year.
- Cheers!</font>

228
00:18:06,898 --> 00:18:07,690
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Cheers!</font>

229
00:18:10,985 --> 00:18:12,237
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I might be too late.</font>

230
00:18:20,411 --> 00:18:21,454
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako...</font>

231
00:18:24,249 --> 00:18:26,334
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Either way, I want to go!</font>

232
00:18:27,127 --> 00:18:29,754
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- The after-party's at karaoke!
- Who's coming?!</font>

233
00:18:29,838 --> 00:18:32,590
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya, you should come too! Let's go!</font>

234
00:18:42,267 --> 00:18:43,935
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I want to be there!</font>

235
00:19:08,543 --> 00:19:10,503
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I was thinking "just maybe..."</font>

236
00:19:16,259 --> 00:19:18,094
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And you're here!</font>

237
00:19:22,557 --> 00:19:27,812
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah.</font>

238
00:19:35,528 --> 00:19:39,365
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The party's over and we
already did the gift exchange...</font>

239
00:19:40,575 --> 00:19:43,369
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...But this one's yours, Kuronuma.</font>

240
00:19:47,790 --> 00:19:51,211
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Although... it might be useless.</font>

241
00:20:00,178 --> 00:20:03,056
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">U-Uhm...</font>

242
00:20:10,188 --> 00:20:14,609
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Actually... I don't really know
how to use something like this...</font>

243
00:20:19,948 --> 00:20:20,865
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Let me see.</font>

244
00:20:34,254 --> 00:20:35,171
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And sent!</font>

245
00:20:36,631 --> 00:20:40,051
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I got my very first cell phone... and in
my contacts, the first name entered was</font>

246
00:20:40,134 --> 00:20:43,554
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya's.</font>

247
00:20:44,722 --> 00:20:49,602
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The loneliness I felt... When I couldn't
make it in time... Oh, that's right, I have</font>

248
00:20:49,686 --> 00:20:52,605
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">a present to give to
you too... in exchange...</font>

249
00:20:52,689 --> 00:20:55,608
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait, seriously? No way!</font>

250
00:20:57,777 --> 00:21:00,446
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Woah, so it's a neck warmer, right?</font>

251
00:21:02,615 --> 00:21:05,994
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The tiny miracle... of a little mix-up...</font>

252
00:21:07,036 --> 00:21:09,831
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A belly...</font>

253
00:21:10,456 --> 00:21:13,251
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">All if it made a Merry Christmas!</font>

254
00:22:27,241 --> 00:22:29,619
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The school bell echoes...</font>

255
00:22:29,702 --> 00:22:31,954
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A remaining small regret...</font>

256
00:22:32,830 --> 00:22:34,874
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: "The Two"</font>
